@startuml
title Niner Skills Quest - completed-course persistence flow

actor Student
boundary "Course entry UI" as UI
control "Course service/API" as Service
control "Course repository" as Repository
database "PostgreSQL database" as DB

Student -> UI: Search and select a supported course
UI -> Service: Request course selection
Service -> Service: Validate course ID and duplicate state
alt Invalid or duplicate course
  Service --> UI: Recoverable validation error
else Valid selection
  Service -> Repository: Save student-course selection
  Repository -> DB: Insert StudentCourse
  DB --> Repository: Persisted record
  Repository --> Service: Saved selection
  Service --> UI: Refresh courses and mapped skills
  UI --> Student: Show saved course and skills
end

Student -> UI: Restart application
UI -> Service: Request saved courses
Service -> Repository: Load StudentCourse records
Repository -> DB: Query StudentCourse with CourseSkill
DB --> Repository: Courses and mapped skills
Repository --> Service: Saved courses and skills
Service --> UI: Render persisted selections
UI --> Student: Show saved course and skills
@enduml
